{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-05_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-05","title":"官僚主义","storyCode":"4-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-05_end.txt","sourceHash":"0b6a46675a197f9a9bb987b101e08ce458aa4cb5a5f28678f69df20f19ab0c5d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"陈终于松口，决定与罗德岛合作。\n而与凯尔希交流过后，阿米娅决定前去营救陨星小队。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"事已至此......我们已经没有别的选择。如果陈长官拒绝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那么罗德岛就会单方面出动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"况且这一行为，并不破坏罗德岛与龙门之间的协约。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局当然会去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是，是吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那我代表罗德岛感谢陈长官——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，感染者对于龙门而言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这是小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，我对于近卫局各个小队是否能突入分城内部还有一定的疑虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我们将见机行事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可能的话，我们一定会帮助你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但近卫局依然会以处理整合运动这一任务为最优先。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这样......这样就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢你，陈长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我有自己的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"设备另一头的那个医生，听到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我会与罗德岛一起行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，小心点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"事情并不单纯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我会小心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我陆续建立了一些综合情报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛已经派出了救援小队，协助其他参与任务的侦察小队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只不过陨星他们所在的地方，我们无法深入，无能为力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这要靠你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只有陨星她们吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。我会去找她们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会将把坐标发送给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"记住，一切以安全为最优先。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，什么时候出发？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我去整备。你通知一下近卫局的其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，十分钟之后，我们一起出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你们一定要平安无事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]}]}
